      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "救主……你名字的意义是“救赎”啊。提高自己，\n从血脉诅咒中拯救自己，那才是你需要记住的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1591ffcdfbbcfbf949439815582c8f42c8cd4ce010acb039978440d600f412ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
