      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救主……我希望你不要责备自己。\n你……“你们”真的很强。那份强大――",
      "source_fingerprint": "50a4e9cc40dfcd1c09c2fede22d0ade2927389ecf26cfdf915863b1132e747fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
