      "uid": "zhcn:7af2d4560d8587354025c6d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是……这样么……这个春天，我陷入了执迷不悟，落败了。\n过去的宿敌告诉我她“超越了自己”。那么……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb1613fdbfa1c18ddd98ea78af5087cd9e7bdfdba56ce33eeb5d076936cc233a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
