    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbee11b219f826e2e058d82e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我会改变我的想法。今后只为比任何人都\n敬爱母亲的自己而跑……为了救赎。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f786f2bcbaa6b8b5fffd6c411b1b5a4b9b7462a88913b1b9a05584dc1e037c95",
